 "scratch": "设计情境：班级采购运动会饮料。苹果汁单价2.8元，橙汁单价3.2元，各买15瓶；矿泉水单价1.5元，买20瓶。总预算150元。第一步利用乘法分配律简算果汁总价：(2.8+3.2)×15=6×15=90。第二步算矿泉水：1.5×20=30。第三步求和并比较：90+30=120 < 150，够，剩30元。",
 "solver_code": "from decimal import Decimal\ndef solve():\n    price_apple = Decimal('2.8')\n    price_orange = Decimal('3.2')\n    count_juice = 15\n    price_water = Decimal('1.5')\n    count_water = 20\n    budget = Decimal('150')\n    \n    # 简算逻辑：(2.8 + 3.2) * 15\n    total_juice = (price_apple + price_orange) * count_juice\n    total_water = price_water * count_water\n    total_cost = total_juice + total_water\n    remaining = budget - total_cost\n    \n    is_enough = remaining >= 0\n    return [is_enough, remaining]",
 "figure": null,
 "stem": "四年级一班为运动会采购饮料：苹果汁每瓶 $2.8$ 元，橙汁每瓶 $3.2$ 元，两种果汁各买 $15$ 瓶；矿泉水每瓶 $1.5$ 元，买 $20$ 瓶。班长带了 $150$ 元班费，钱够吗？如果够，还剩多少元？",
 "options": [],
